  * deciding_field, deciding_field_alternates[*], deciding_field_contract: regex findall r'[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?:\[[0-9]+\])?(?:\.[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?:\[[0-9]+\])?)*' — but this will also match words like "plus" and "UNVERIFIED"? In `deciding_field_contract` strings like "f0_binding.declared_f0_sha256 plus f0_binding.rule" → tokens f0_binding.declared_f0_sha256, plus, f0_binding.rule. The bare word "plus" isn't a valid top-level key; resolution check will drop unresolvable tokens. Also alternates are explicit.
